# The build context is the repository root, so this excludes everything outside
# the two directories the build needs, and the build output inside them.
*
!libs/runtime
!apps/runtime/core

libs/runtime/**/target/
libs/runtime/**/.venv/
libs/runtime/**/node_modules/
libs/runtime/**/__pycache__/
libs/runtime/benchmarks/
libs/runtime/docs/
libs/runtime/api-docs/
libs/runtime/**/*.md

apps/runtime/core/target/
apps/runtime/core/resources/
apps/runtime/core/*.md
apps/runtime/core/.env*
